# Project Planning Phase - Implement Client Script & UI Policy for Incident

## 1. Project Goals
- To implement Client Scripts and UI Policies to enhance Incident Management form in ServiceNow.
- To ensure data validation and dynamic form behavior.

## 2. Scope of the Project
- Incident table (incident)
- Client Scripts: onLoad, onChange, onSubmit
- UI Policies and UI Policy Actions

## 3. Timeline / Milestones
- Week 1: Requirement Analysis and Brainstorming
- Week 2: Design Phase - Form layout and field behavior planning
- Week 3: Implementation - Create Client Scripts and UI Policies in PDI
- Week 4: Testing and Documentation in GitHub

## 4. Resources Required
- ServiceNow PDI (Personal Developer Instance)
- GitHub for documentation
- Incident Management module knowledge

## 5. Risk & Mitigation
- Risk: Client Script conflicts with UI Policy
- Mitigation: Use proper order and condition checking

## 6. Team Roles
- Developer: Configure Client Scripts and UI Policies
- Tester: Test in different scenarios
- Documentation: Maintain GitHub repo
